<FeatureFacts id="social" />

Share workouts, PRs, splits and library items; follow people; like, comment and reply. Ask
questions and start threads in the Forum, a tab in Social, with or without a group; a forum post
from someone you follow, or in one of your groups, shows in your feed as a title card. Tag any post
with #anything, like #sligo or #deadlift, and tap a tag to see every post with it. Join groups for
their chat, events, board and posts. Social is free with any account, on the phone and on the web.

Public means public everywhere: a public account's profile and posts, every forum post and every
tag can be read by anyone at getlogit.app and found on Google, no account needed. A private
account's profile and posts, and forum posts in an invite-only group, are never on the web.

